    "start": "00:01:17.120",
    "end": "00:01:17.957",
    "text": "怎么了怎么了？",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "慌张",
    "voice": "语速偏快",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "start": "00:01:18.079",
    "end": "00:01:19.957",
    "text": "江清池，你怎么还没有过来？",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "不满",
    "voice": "语气带着质问",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "start": "00:01:20.079",
    "end": "00:01:24.437",
    "text": "哦，我路上有点堵车，马上就到了，你让爸妈一定坚持住啊！",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "焦急",
    "voice": "语气急促",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "start": "00:01:24.760",
    "end": "00:01:26.117",
    "text": "行吧，那你快点。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "无奈",
    "voice": "语气妥协",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "start": "00:01:26.440",
    "end": "00:01:28.557",
    "text": "我知道了我知道了，你们一定要等我啊！",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "急切",
    "voice": "语速偏快",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
